OL,3,AUkrainian evacuees reunite with family
OL,4,Aafter years trapped in Russia-occupied
OL,5,Acity
OL,6,
OL,7,FSome elderly residents were so weak
OL,8,Fthey were carried on stretchers. They
OL,9,Fhad been trapped in the frontline city
OL,10,Fwithout food, water and electricity,
OL,11,Fwith many resorting to cooking garden
OL,12,Fweeds to survive.
OL,14,FUkrainian President Volodymyr Zelensky
OL,15,Fthanked US First Lady Melania Trump for
OL,16,Fher efforts in brokering a local
OL,17,Fceasefire that paved the way for their
OL,18,Fevacuation on Friday.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
