OL,3,AMore than 5,000 die from Ebola in DR
OL,4,ACongo's deadliest outbreak
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 5,000 people have died from
OL,7,Fan ongoing Ebola outbreak in the
OL,8,FDemocratic Republic of Congo,
OL,9,Fgovernment data shows.
OL,11,FEight of 26 provinces are now affected,
OL,12,Fwith more than 10,300 confirmed cases.
OL,14,FThe outbreak, which started in May,
OL,15,Fbecame the country's deadliest in its
OL,16,Fhistory in August, public health
OL,17,Fofficials said. The current case
OL,18,Ffatality rate is 48.6%.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
